tc.research_name.THAUMONOMICON_ATLAS=All-Seeing Thaumonomicon
tc.research_text.THAUMONOMICON_ATLAS=Unification of Knowledge, Revealing, and Cartography
tc.research_page.THAUMONOMICON_ATLAS.1=By combining Goggles of Revealing, a Thaumometer, and a Vis-sensitive Amulet with your Thaumonomicon on an Infusion Matrix, you have created the All-Seeing Thaumonomicon.<BR>This mystical tome grants you the vision of Goggles of Revealing simply while carried in your inventory.<BR>Right-clicking opens your Thaumonomicon as usual, while Shift + Right-Clicking opens the magical Node Atlas to track and locate all surveyed aura nodes.
tc.research_page.THAUMONOMICON_ATLAS.2=The built-in Atlas features compass navigation pointing towards any selected aura node in the world.

